Modifications made by Katharina Kampa (2026):

  - Added sequence perturbation logic (`perturb_sequence`) to generate an
    ensemble of mutated variants of the input protein sequence.
  - Extended the prediction pipeline to run AlphaFold across the perturbed
    sequence ensemble and aggregate results (mean, standard deviation).
  - Added loading and parsing of experimental ground-truth structures from
    PDB files via Biopython.
  - Added quantitative evaluation of prediction uncertainty: Mean Absolute
    Error (MAE), Root Mean Square Error (RMSE), confidence interval width,
    prediction variance, coverage, and Concordance Correlation Coefficient
    (CCC), comparing predicted structures against the experimental structure.
  - Added corresponding visualizations of prediction error and uncertainty.

